% Bibliography for the CorpusSLR SoftwareX submission.
%
% Every entry below is one of the records in
% validation/references_verified.json, whose metadata was confirmed against
% Crossref or the publisher record. No entry is added that is not in that
% file, so that nothing in the reference list rests on recollection.
%
% Two of the DOIs added in 1.0.0 had to be corrected against Crossref's
% title search: the identifier recalled for Rathbone et al. (2015) resolved
% to an erratum for a different paper, and the one recalled for Ouzzani et
% al. (2016) returned HTTP 404. Both are recorded here as resolved, which is
% the reason this file exists.
%
% Page ranges are written as 181\pageto 217 rather than 181-217 on purpose.
% BibTeX's n.dashify function in elsarticle-num.bst rewrites ANY literal hyphen
% in the pages field into an en dash "--" in the generated .bbl, and brace or
% \mbox protection does not stop it (all four variants were tested). Since the
% project forbids en dashes in the typeset output, the hyphen is emitted by the
% \pageto macro defined in the .tex preamble: the .bib then contains no hyphen
% for n.dashify to find, and the PDF shows 181-217.
%
% Note on Singh et al. (2021): only the containment direction reported in
% their abstract is cited in the article (99.11% of WoS journals are also in
% Scopus). The reverse percentage that appeared in an early project
% specification is not in the paper and is not cited; see the
% "rejected_claims" field of the verification file.

